<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54650" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάντ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>downhill, steep</i>, opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάντης, κ. ἀτραπός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					127
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰ κατάντεα</span>
			<i>downwards</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ κάταντες,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάταντα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				77d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸ κάταντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					8.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ κατάντει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.8.37
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ κατάντους</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.5.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοῖς κατάντεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diocl.Fr.
					142
				</span></i>
			: neut. as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάταντες κινεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					248a22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κατάντη ἁμιλλώμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					8.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κ. ἐλαύνεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
					8.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					5.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέρεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					567a7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταβαίνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Lass.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>prone, inclined</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					318
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Nat.</u>
				908.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.53e
			</span></i>.</div>
